IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SUMRANGE.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-INDEX  PIC 9(2) VALUE 1.
01  WS-TOTAL  PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    PERFORM VARYING WS-INDEX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-INDEX > 5
        ADD WS-INDEX TO WS-TOTAL
    END-PERFORM.
    DISPLAY "TOTAL: " WS-TOTAL.
    IF WS-TOTAL > 10
        DISPLAY "TOTAL EXCEEDS TEN"
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "TOTAL IS TEN OR LESS"
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.
